&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt; Head of AI &amp;amp; Applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
